# Unblessed: Session charge requests (#1795); first blessing awaits human review.
# A suspending mock declared `read-only` takes `:charge`: an accepted request
# spends Fuel at once, a request the Run can't pay faults it at the call, and
# a mock that isn't metered refuses one. `read-only` needs a suspending mock,
# and `:charge` a whole amount and a pending mock call.
> :mock feed.fetch suspending read-only
> :mock feed.plain suspending
> :mock feed.now immediate read-only
! bad arguments
> :mock feed.poll suspending metered
! bad arguments
> :clock virtual 2026-09-30T10:00:00Z
> on pull
|   ask feed to fetch and wait
|   say "got " & it
| end pull
> send pull to session
[session/r2] call session/r2.c1 feed.fetch []
> :charge session/r2.c1 5
> :charge session/r2.c1 x
! bad arguments
> :charge session/r9.c1 1
! no such call
> :answer session/r2.c1 "news"
[session/r2] got news
> send pull to session
[session/r4] call session/r4.c1 feed.fetch []
> :charge session/r4.c1 9007199254740991
[session/r4] ! limit fault fuel at session+1:2:3
> on plain
|   ask feed to plain and wait
| end plain
> send plain to session
[session/r6] call session/r6.c1 feed.plain []
> :charge session/r6.c1 1
! invalid value
